<mxfile host="generate.py" type="device"><diagram id="kit-workflow" name="kit-workflow"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1930" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t58" value="&lt;b&gt;Generic kit state machine (infra/constructs/kit_workflow.py)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontSize=18;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="1890" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g59" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#545B64;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="88" width="470" height="792" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t60" value="&lt;b&gt;The machine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Step Functions Standard machine per kit action, named &lt;font face='monospace'&gt;awx-&amp;lt;kit&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;action&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;, laid out from the action's manifest: step order, finality loops, approval timeout and fan-out come from the kit's workflow spec&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pink states invoke the kit-step Lambda, which runs the workflow engine phase by phase. Orange states invoke the spine's mutation adapter Lambda. The kit-step Lambda holds no Airwallex secret&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;local_runner&lt;/font&gt; runs the same phases in the same order; a test interprets the synthesised ASL and checks both runners agree&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;Approval&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;Every proposal gets its policy tier. A model-started proposal is raised to at least SINGLE unless the action's spec sets agent_min_tier=AUTO; rule 11 in docs/workflow-rules.md lists the actions that do&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AUTO goes straight to Recheck. BLOCKED goes to Audit and moves nothing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SINGLE or DUAL waits on waitForTaskToken until the approval Lambda sends the token back or the approval TTL ends&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Binding accepts only a decision that names the stored proposal hash and comes from someone other than the proposer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A child machine has no approval states: its root already holds the approval&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sending&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Adapter task never retries a send. Only a throttle on the invoke itself (the Lambda never ran) is retried&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A timeout, crash or any other error after a possible send goes to Crashed, which reconciles before the engine decides whether to resend&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A refusal (not authorised, tenant scope, request id reuse) goes to Error with nothing sent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Finality steps wait, read and route until the object reaches a terminal status&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;Closing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;AfterStop runs the postcondition when one is due, then Audit writes the outcome&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Postcondition and Audit have no automatic retry, so each runs once&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Error states are omitted from the drawing for clarity. Recheck, Binding, Build, Result, Crashed, FinalityCheck, AdapterComplete, Completed, and in kit 6 FanOut, Children and ChildrenDone, catch into Error, then AfterStop; RequestApproval sends a timeout to Binding and any other failure to Error&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Postcondition catches into PostconditionError, then Audit; a failure in Start fails the execution&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fan-out (kit 6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;FanOut computes one child intent per employer; the inline Map starts &lt;font face='monospace'&gt;&amp;lt;machine&amp;gt;-child&lt;/font&gt; for each (startExecution.sync, at most 5 at once)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ChildrenDone collects the child outcomes before AfterStop&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;Code locations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:1px 0 5px 0;padding-left:16px'&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;infra/constructs/kit_workflow.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;packages/awx_spine_aws&lt;/font&gt;: engine and kit-step handler&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face='monospace'&gt;packages/awx_common&lt;/font&gt;: workflow spec and runner rules&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1452" y="96" width="446" height="776" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s1" value="Start: validate, policy, store proposal (risk tier)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75.0" y="98.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s2" value="RiskTier?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rhombus;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90.0" y="195.0" width="120" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="RequestApproval: waitForTaskToken, timeout = approval TTL" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDECEE;strokeColor=#DD344C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="65.0" y="322.0" width="170" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s4" value="Binding: decision matches proposal hash, not the proposer" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75.0" y="448.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5" value="Approved?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rhombus;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90.0" y="555.0" width="120" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s6" value="Recheck: policy again on fresh reads" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="345.0" y="98.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s7" value="Rechecked?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rhombus;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360.0" y="195.0" width="120" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s8" value="FanOut, then Children: inline Map (max 5) starting one child execution each, then ChildrenDone" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#E6F6F4;strokeColor=#01A88D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="315.0" y="668.0" width="210" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s9" value="Build&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: operations for step N" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="625.0" y="98.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s10" value="Route&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;? (choice)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600.0" y="205.0" width="200" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s11" value="Dispatch&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rhombus;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640.0" y="315.0" width="120" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s12" value="ResendWait&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7D8998;dashed=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="465.0" y="450.0" width="110" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s13" value="Adapter&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: mutation adapter Lambda (never retried)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF3E6;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="625.0" y="448.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s14" value="Crashed&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: reconcile before any resend" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="625.0" y="568.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s15" value="FinalityCheck&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: read until terminal" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="875.0" y="98.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s16" value="FinalityWait&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7D8998;dashed=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890.0" y="210.0" width="120" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s17" value="AdapterComplete&amp;lt;N&amp;gt; (adapter), then Completed&amp;lt;N&amp;gt; (kit-step)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF3E6;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="865.0" y="322.0" width="170" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s18" value="Result&amp;lt;N&amp;gt;: record the reply" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="875.0" y="448.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s19" value="Error: record the failure" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="98.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s20" value="AfterStop?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rhombus;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140.0" y="195.0" width="120" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s21" value="Postcondition" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="328.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s22" value="Audit" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FDEBF3;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="448.0" width="150" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s23" value="Done" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;ellipse;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160.0" y="568.0" width="80" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e24" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" target="s2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e25" value="AUTO" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="260" y="230"/><mxPoint x="260" y="109"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="SINGLE or DUAL (root only)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="BLOCKED" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="50" y="230"/><mxPoint x="50" y="800"/><mxPoint x="1340" y="800"/><mxPoint x="1340" y="481"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="token or timeout" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="s4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s4" target="s5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="APPROVED" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s5" target="s6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="330" y="590"/><mxPoint x="330" y="131"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" value="rejected or expired" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s5" target="s22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="150" y="760"/><mxPoint x="1080" y="760"/><mxPoint x="1080" y="481"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s6" target="s7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e33" value="steps" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" target="s9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="540" y="230"/><mxPoint x="540" y="120"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e34" value="fan-out" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" target="s8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" value="stopped" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.75;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" target="s20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="520" y="212.5"/><mxPoint x="520" y="65"/><mxPoint x="1110" y="65"/><mxPoint x="1110" y="212.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e36" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s9" target="s10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e37" value="next step" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s10" target="s9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="575" y="220"/><mxPoint x="575" y="80"/><mxPoint x="700" y="80"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e38" value="pending" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s10" target="s11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e39" value="finality" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s10" target="s16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="850" y="220"/><mxPoint x="850" y="230"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e40" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s16" target="s15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e41" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s15" target="s10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="830" y="120"/><mxPoint x="830" y="240"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e42" value="last step done, or stop" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;st